WEBVTT

00:07:29.704 --> 00:07:32.538
and my sister is very dark and sarcastic.

00:07:33.621 --> 00:07:35.454
And she has low self-esteem,

00:07:35.496 --> 00:07:37.454
which is weird because she has my face.

00:07:37.829 --> 00:07:40.746
(Laughter)

00:07:40.913 --> 00:07:44.579
Do you know what it’s like
when someone that looks exactly like you

00:07:44.621 --> 00:07:47.954
calls you up and goes, “I feel so ugly?”

00:07:47.996 --> 00:07:50.246
(Laughter and applause)

00:07:50.288 --> 00:07:51.788
You guys have been phenomenal.

00:07:51.788 --> 00:07:52.913
I’ve been Gina Brillon.

00:07:52.913 --> 00:07:54.121
Thank you so much, guys.

00:07:54.121 --> 00:07:57.496
(Applause and cheers)